{"v":4,"catch":"來自陰間的復仇，對被詛咒的 \"Yoritomo \"的復仇！ 。","desc":"《The Genji and the Heike Clans》是NAMCO於1986年發行的動作遊戲。\n玩家控制英雄“Taira no Kagekiyo”前往首都鎌倉執行任務，擊敗“Demon Genji Clan's king Yoritomo”。\n在前往鎌倉的途中，玩家將面臨“Yoshitsune”和“Benkei”等源氏族士兵的攻擊。 擊敗所有挑戰者並收集三件聖寶以擊敗“Yoritomo”。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-10-07","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa2a594d65c4cd4385379fbfc3df4d74ab86b9a592f224a5114d910ea7a77ac0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a6f2bfcfcdb1e3f260cdb29ed283555e545118c639efd7a5a133b273d8202f7a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/338837d292d48539b3bd617da799f514f217e42c829b66396ed382d53ec49a77.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b9d0ed97efb791b3856d6dcded5c55832ac156556b2cd27bc404bc4a649c1b0e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d73f5fd4cbd5e2a795f1bc74d68a5ee3b2777897e836aef61bfab72165f4cc02.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/89be533d63783d91fe7360d07f46e11ba516d42dc8dfd8e736837967bf0d53f9.jpg"],"titleId":"01006f7015ac0000","dlc":[]}